---
import { url } from "../../lib/site";
---

<section class="ink-panel section">
  <div class="shell open-format">
    <div class="open-format__copy">
      <h2 class="display-lg">Nothing here<br />locks you in.</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        A memory you cannot open is a memory you cannot correct, move or trust.
        It is plain markdown in a folder: open it in any editor, put it in git,
        copy it to another machine. The database holds a search index beside it;
        the files stay the source of truth.
      </p>
      <ul class="open-format__list">
        <li>An identity document whose every revision names its author</li>
        <li>Memory you can search by passage, follow by link, and export as .zip</li>
        <li>A nightly reflection written down, not hidden</li>
        <li>MIT licensed, no external service, no lock-in</li>
      </ul>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <span class="chip chip-inverse">markdown</span>
        <span class="chip chip-inverse">sqlite index</span>
        <span class="chip chip-inverse">.zip</span>
        <span class="chip chip-inverse">MIT</span>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={url("/docs/configuration/memory/")} style="margin-top:4px">
        How memory works
      </a>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
      <div class="code-card">
        <div class="code-card__bar">
          <span>CORE.md</span>
          <span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">rev 7 · dream cycle</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="tok-muted"># CORE.md</span>
I am the Seneschal.
I keep the ledger, the calendar,
and the quiet between requests.

<span class="tok-muted">## Voice</span>
Plain, precise, warm. No ceremony
where a clear answer will do.</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="code-card">
        <div class="code-card__bar">
          <span>seneschal/memory/court/</span>
          <span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">memory</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="tok-muted">seneschal/memory/court/</span>
  index.md          <span class="tok-muted"># maintained</span>
  log.md            <span class="tok-muted"># maintained</span>
  festival.md       <span class="tok-live"># live passage</span>
  decisions.md
  vendors.md
  charter.md

<span class="tok-muted">[festival] → [decisions] → [charter]</span></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
